# Tier-B surfaces: the owner reviews and merges these. The main-integrity ruleset requires a
# code-owner review, so GitHub — not the runner's policy script — enforces that no PR touching a
# path listed here merges without the owner. Deliberately no `*` catch-all: a runner PR must not
# need an approval it cannot obtain for tier-A code. Keep in step with lib/policy.sh.
/.github/                      @gitchrisqueen
/.claude/                      @gitchrisqueen
/.mcp.json                     @gitchrisqueen
/.gitmodules                   @gitchrisqueen
/Scripts/agent-runner/         @gitchrisqueen
/Scripts/verify/               @gitchrisqueen
/Scripts/*.sh                  @gitchrisqueen
/Tools/                        @gitchrisqueen
/Packages/CueSyncCore/         @gitchrisqueen
/App/Config/                   @gitchrisqueen
/App/Resources/                @gitchrisqueen
/project.yml                   @gitchrisqueen
/.gitleaks.toml                @gitchrisqueen
/.swiftlint.yml                @gitchrisqueen
/README.md                     @gitchrisqueen
/CLAUDE.md                     @gitchrisqueen
/CONTRIBUTING.md               @gitchrisqueen
/docs/                         @gitchrisqueen
# Dependencies and binary/model assets, wherever they live.
**/Package.swift               @gitchrisqueen
**/Package@swift-*.swift       @gitchrisqueen
Package.resolved               @gitchrisqueen
*.png                          @gitchrisqueen
*.jpg                          @gitchrisqueen
*.jpeg                         @gitchrisqueen
*.heic                         @gitchrisqueen
*.mlmodel                      @gitchrisqueen
**/*.mlpackage/**              @gitchrisqueen
